  "strapline": "At the Eric Wright Group, our business is based on a simple principle. <strong>We believe that the greatest achievement in life, is what we achieve together.</strong>",
  "about": {
    "title": "Making real progress together.",
    "body": "<p>Every day, we work with a collective sense of purpose, building lasting relationships based on shared values and the drive to construct, engineer and manage with real social impact. Working on infrastructure projects, large and small, with like-minded local contractors, creators, suppliers and specialists who share our standards and dedication to creating positive and lasting change.</p>\n<p>Because together, we make a difference.</p>",
    "image": "/media/home/eric-wright/image-split/image.png",
    "cta": {
      "label": "More about us",
      "href": "/about"
    }
